<title>CHILE: Andina reports higher 9-month net.</title>
<headline>Andina reports higher 9-month net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean bottler Embotelladora Andina reported the following results in the first nine months of 1996 against the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>				9-mo 1996		9-mo 1995</p>
<p> Net profit		   23.7			19.8</p>
<p> Operating profit	   19.49		     18.52</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	7.25			3.13</p>
<p> Total revenues	     95.70		     88.66</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
